\": \"将原图意面升级为米其林级龙虾松露意面，测试食物替换、材质增强、商业美食摄影能力。\",\n  \"preserve\": [\n    \"original bowl angle\",\n    \"tabletop composition\",\n    \"main food framing\",\n    \"shallow depth of field\",\n    \"realistic food photography base\"\n  ],\n  \"edit_instructions\": {\n    \"main_edit\": \"Transform the current pasta dish into a Michelin-style lobster truffle tagliatelle.\",\n    \"replace_or_add\": [\n      \"butter-poached lobster chunks\",\n      \"shaved black truffle\",\n      \"glossy creamy sauce\",\n      \"parmesan foam\",\n      \"fresh basil\",\n      \"subtle steam\",\n      \"premium restaurant plating\"\n    ],\n    \"style\": \"refined high-end Italian restaurant food commercial\",\n    \"texture_rule\": \"Enhance ingredient texture, sauce gloss, pasta elasticity, lobster surface detail, and appetizing realism.\"\n  },\n  \"final_prompt\": \"Use the input image as the base composition. Transform the current pasta dish into a Michelin-style lobster truffle tagliatelle. Replace the original toppings with butter-poached lobster chunks, shaved black truffle, glossy creamy sauce, parmesan foam, and fresh basil. Keep the bowl angle and tabletop composition, but upgrade the scene into a refined high-end Italian restaurant food commercial. Enhance ingredient texture, steam, sauce gloss, pasta elasticity, lobster surface detail, and appetizing realism. Make it elegant, premium, photorealistic, and clean, with strong food styling and shallow depth of field.\",\n  \"negative_prompt\": [\n    \"low quality\",\n    \"blurry\",\n    \"messy food\",\n    \"unappetizing texture\",\n    \"distorted bowl\",\n    \"fake ingredients\",\n    \"plastic food\",\n    \"oversaturated sauce\",\n    \"too many tiny particles\",\n    \"cluttered tabletop\",\n    \"over-sharpening\",\n    \"text\",\n    \"logo\",\n    \"watermark\"\n  ]\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 27, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text